{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "OpenTask Task Source Contract API",
    "description": "OpenTask 以「通用任务源」形态对外暴露的任务契约（对接 Orca 等 AI 编排工具，\n模拟 Jira 对接模式）。\n\n- 鉴权：`Authorization: Bearer <API Key(vk_) 或 JWT>`；先用\n  `POST /tasks/token`（OAuth2 client credentials）以 API Key 换短时效 JWT，\n  或直接以 API Key 作 Bearer 凭证。除 `POST /tasks/token` 与\n  `GET /capabilities` 外均需凭证。\n- 错误体：契约层语义错误统一为 `{\"detail\": {\"code\": \"CONTRACT_*\",\n  \"message\": \"...\"}}`（401 CONTRACT_AUTH_MISSING/INVALID、403\n  CONTRACT_FORBIDDEN、404 CONTRACT_TASK_NOT_FOUND、422\n  CONTRACT_STATUS_UNKNOWN、503 CONTRACT_UNAVAILABLE）。\n- 能力协商：先调 `GET /capabilities` 获取生效状态词表、分页/游标特性\n  与禁操作表，再按能力调用。\n- 完整文档见 backend/README.md「任务源契约 API」章节。\n",
    "version": "1.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/tasks": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "任务源契约 (Task Source Contract)"
        ],
        "summary": "List Tasks",
        "description": "列出任务（过滤 + 分页 + updated_since 增量游标）",
        "operationId": "list_tasks_tasks_get",
        "security": [
          {
            "HTTPBearer": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "status",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "description": "通用状态过滤（词表见 GET /capabilities.status_vocabulary）",
              "title": "Status"
            },
            "description": "通用状态过滤（词表见 GET /capabilities.status_vocabulary）"
          },
          {
            "name": "assignee",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "description": "负责人 user ID 过滤",
              "title": "Assignee"
            },
            "description": "负责人 user ID 过滤"
          },
          {
            "name": "updated_since",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "date-time"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "description": "增量游标：仅返回 updated_at 严格大于该时刻的任务（排他）",
              "title": "Updated Since"
            },
            "description": "增量游标：仅返回 updated_at 严格大于该时刻的任务（排他）"
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "maximum": 200,
              "minimum": 1,
              "description": "分页大小",
              "default": 50,
              "title": "Limit"
            },
            "description": "分页大小"
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "description": "分页偏移",
              "default": 0,
              "title": "Offset"
            },
            "description": "分页偏移"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ContractTaskListResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "缺凭证/凭证无效（CONTRACT_AUTH_MISSING / CONTRACT_AUTH_INVALID）",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ContractErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "操作被配置禁用（CONTRACT_FORBIDDEN，contract.forbidden_operations）",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ContractErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "schema 违规：结构性问题返回 FastAPI 标准校验体（detail=[{loc,msg,type}]）；状态值不在生效词表内返回 detail={code: CONTRACT_STATUS_UNKNOWN, message}"
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "后端依赖（数据库）不可达（CONTRACT_UNAVAILABLE）",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ContractErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
